    <reapack name="ReaKit FX" type="effect" desc="ReaKit FX - GainKit, Saturation, 3-Band EQ, DDC and De-Esser: free effects with EON Studios interfaces (the ReaKit library)">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[Five free effects with EON Studios interfaces. Saturation, 3-Band EQ and DDC (Digital Drum Compressor) by Michael Gruhn (LOSER) and a De-Esser built on Lubomir I. Ivanov's (Liteon), free as their authors released them, with their original terms and credits (LICENSE.md); and GainKit, EON's own gain-staging plugin (MIT). The shared interface library that comes with them is ReaKit (MIT).]]></description>
        <link rel="repository">https://github.com/mequaz-sudo/ReaKit-FX</link>
      </metadata>
