      <version name="1.1.0" author="Quaz (EON Studios)" time="2026-09-28T17:15:44Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[The effects have their own repository now; this is the same package, continued. New: GainKit, EON's gain-staging plugin -- an analog VU (the ReaKit meter), one GAIN knob and a STEREO / MONO key, with a mixer-strip face that shows the VU over the knob, the VU alone or the knob alone, its numerals or ticks only, and a VU that grows flatter as the strip is dragged wider; a name you type on the meter's face; hidden HP / LP filters, trims and M/S kept as parameters for old projects. Every plugin's shared includes match ReaKit 1.7.0.]]></changelog>
