      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[Companion scripts for GainKit (ReaKit FX). GainKit Plus, a background action, feeds every GainKit its track's name, colour and icon, and can start with REAPER. The others act on every GainKit in the project: Insert on selected tracks, GainKit first in every chain, Reset all gains, All MONO, All STEREO and Bypass all. MIT, EON Studios.]]></description>
        <link rel="repository">https://github.com/mequaz-sudo/ReaKit-FX</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.0.0" author="Quaz (EON Studios)" time="2026-09-28T20:57:54Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[First release. GainKit Plus (a toggle: run it to start, run it again to stop) feeds every GainKit in the project its track's name, colour and icon while it runs. Six more actions: Insert on selected tracks (GainKit first in the chain of every selected track that has none), GainKit first in every chain (moves the GainKit a track already has to the top, the master's too), Reset all gains (every GainKit's GAIN to 0 dB), All MONO and All STEREO (every GainKit's key at once) and Bypass all (all off; again, all on). Each is one undo step. Needs GainKit 2.3.0 (ReaKit FX 1.2.0).]]></changelog>
